  "prompt": "Finance wants one row per completed order, including orders without payments or items. Return order_id, paid_total and unit_total. Sum each payment and item exactly once. Treat NULL amounts/units and missing child rows as zero. Other order statuses must be excluded. Child IDs are unique; unrelated child rows may exist. Output order does not matter.",
